Phase 887: Aromatic & Ornamental Plant Administration Modules - 3 new WASM application modules:

1. modules/lantana_admin/src/main.c (Lantana Shrub Verbena Administration)
   - Base ID: 2087
   - Manages lantana (Lantana camara) ornamental shrub cultivation
   - Features: shrub inventory (16 plants), flower cluster tracking, color variety catalog (multi-color blooms), pruning schedule, invasive species management, pollinator attraction records, landscape use tracking, propagation from cuttings
   - Domain structs: lantana_t (id, plant_id, age_months, cluster_count, color_variety, prune_month, invasive_risk, pollinator_count, landscape_zone, propagate_type, active)
   - Functions: lantana_init, lantana_plant_inventory, lantana_cluster_track, lantana_color_catalog, lantana_prune_schedule, lantana_invasive_manage, lantana_pollinator_track, lantana_propagate
   - Exports: main (demo: plant inventory, cluster tracking, color catalog, pruning, invasive management, pollinator tracking, propagation)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style (host imports: alloc/print/exit/get_argv, ps/pi helpers, static state, N=16)

2. modules/lathyrus_admin/src/main.c (Lathyrus Sweet Pea Administration)
   - Base ID: 2088
   - Manages lathyrus (Lathyrus odoratus/sweet pea) ornamental vine cultivation
   - Features: vine inventory (16 plants), flower count tracking, fragrance intensity measurement, support structure records, deadheading schedule, seed collection, variety catalog (color/scent), cutting propagation records
   - Domain structs: lathyrus_t (id, plant_id, age_weeks, flower_count, fragrance_level, support_type, deadhead_freq, seed_count, variety_id, propagate_method, active)
   - Functions: lathyrus_init, lathyrus_plant_inventory, lathyrus_flower_track, lathyrus_fragrance_measure, lathyrus_support_install, lathyrus_deadhead_schedule, lathyrus_seed_collect, lathyrus_variety_catalog
   - Exports: main (demo: plant inventory, flower tracking, fragrance measurement, support installation, deadheading, seed collection, variety catalog)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

3. modules/lavandula_admin/src/main.c (Lavandula Lavender Administration)
   - Base ID: 2089
   - Manages lavandula (Lavandula angustifolia/lavender) aromatic herb cultivation
   - Features: plant inventory (16 plants), flower harvest tracking, essential oil distillation records, oil quality analysis (linalool/linalyl acetate content), drying process monitoring, product formulation (culinary/medicinal/cosmetic), organic certification, market distribution tracking
   - Domain structs: lavandula_t (id, plant_id, age_years, flower_kg, oil_ml, linalool_pct, dry_method, product_type, organic_cert, market_region, active)
   - Functions: lavandula_init, lavandula_plant_inventory, lavandula_flower_harvest, lavandula_oil_distill, lavandula_oil_analyze, lavandula_dry_process, lavandula_product_formulate, lavandula_organic_cert
   - Exports: main (demo: plant inventory, flower harvest, oil distillation, oil analysis, drying process, product formulation, organic cert)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

Build all 3 modules with:
  clang --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -Oz -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wl,--no-entry -Wl,--export=main -o modules/<name>/<name>.wasm modules/<name>/src/main.c

